					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dearheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1511549); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1511549&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609146261" alt="Dearheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1511549)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dearheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1511549); return false;" >Dearheart</a></span> <span class="odate time_1415574341 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">09 Nov 2014 23:05</span>
